# cards-gpu-cuda13: the CUDA 13 profile. eagle and hawk (their cuda13 extras bring cupy-cuda13x and the
# CUDA 13 toolkit libraries), NVIDIA Warp (the one comparison arm; its PyPI wheel is built with CUDA 13.4),
# and the kit's own needs. No PyTorch, no JAX. CPython 3.12, Linux x86_64.
# Driver floor: >= 580 (CUDA 13). GPU floor: compute capability 7.5 (CUDA 13 drops offline compilation
# below sm_75). Tested target: RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell (sm_120).
